# jemdoc: menu{menu.jemdoc}{regression-analysis.html}, title{Regression Analysis}, notime

= Regression Analysis

Level: Graduate

*What you will learn:*

- Simple and multiple linear regression
- Least squares fitting and interpretation of coefficients
- Variable selection and model comparison
- Regression diagnostics and residual analysis
- Regularization: ridge and lasso
- Applying the methods to real datasets

